          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Well done, Konrad! Fresh air at last; we have escaped the smoke and fire."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("But the rest of the elves have not; they’re still trapped in the battle! And look — even our friends at Blackwater Port are being attacked!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("With the support of Elensefar and the Aethenwood, it is true that the western reaches have suffered less of the dark queen’s tyranny than have the rest of the realm. But it seems now even this has come to an end."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Then we must do something! Delfador, we can’t keep running away while others get hurt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("You’re quite right, Konrad. I’m afraid there is nothing for it; we shall have to start our campaign against Asheviere sooner than planned. I had hoped to wait until you were older... Hmph, I remember my own master telling me that once."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Don’t worry Delfador, I’m ready. Now come on, let’s go save the kingdom!"),
          },
