          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Konrad",
            unit: "Konrad",
            x: 3,
            y: 32,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("I’m glad I could help make safe your home, but... why choose to live here, of all places? There must be safer hideouts than foggy islands crawling with undead!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delurin",
            text: _("Naw, weren’t always like this. The Three Sisters’ve always been good to us — tough, but fair. These undead be a new thing."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delurin",
            text: _("There’s some old crypts on the west side of the island, see? Our leader went down, hunting for weapons, treasure, magic and what have ye. But instead of her coming back out, all we got was hordes of the dead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delurin",
            text: _("Her and some of her girls are still down there, trapped — or dead. If’n you can help, we’d all be in yer debt. _ If not... well, there’s our port. I’ve got some ships to take ye back to the mainland. We owe you that much."),
          },
        ],
      },
