          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("There it be — what’s left of Halstead. You woulda been barely a year or two old, Konrad. It were a nasty fight, but in the end we knocked the whole thing down, Baldras and I did. I miss him something fierce."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Baldras was your uncle, is that right? Is he not back with the others on the Three Sisters?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("No. He an’ some o’ the family went off to try and rescue a bunch of slaves, somewhere out eastways. Do a good deed, an’ maybe make us some new friends too, you know? But it’s been years, and not one of thems that went out has come back."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Delurin says they’re probably all dead, but I refuse t’ believe it. My uncle Baldras is tougher than that..."),
          },
