            text: _("We have ventured into the heart of Wesnoth, pillaged the queen’s weapons, and lived to tell the tale! From the wagons we’ve gathered a large collection of sabers, spears, and bows — everything we need to outfit new Fencers, Spearmen, and Bowmen!"),
