            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-glad.webp",
            text: _("We have ventured into the heart of Wesnoth and escaped — and with more weapons than we had before! Although we lack the supplies to outfit and promote Bowmen, we’ve pillaged a large collection of sabers and spears for our Fencers and Spearmen!"),
