            text: _("Ssslow, ssslow! It isss disssgusssting how you tall onesss are all ssso ssslow!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("What do you mean, lizard? Both my legs and my sword-arm are perfectly quick — as you will soon find out if you wish me any ill-intent."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tirix",
            text: _("Psssh... I know your kind; tall, and clumsssy. Tirix can teach you ssspeed... yesss, ssspeed... But only if you pay. It ssshall not be cheap."),
          },
