            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relgorn",
            text: _("I know that the trolls’ll return. I know that the orcs’ll return, an’ that many o’ the Doors-folk are still with ’em, enslaved. But ye’ve given us dwarves more breathin’ room than we’ve had in many a year."),
