          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-glad.webp",
            text: _("Finally! Our journey under the mountains has been long and difficult, but at last we return to the open continent — and with a powerful new ally!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("If you’re serious about overthrowing my mother, just my support won’t be enough. And she’s certainly not about to give up the throne just for my sake."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("No, we need to start by dismantling her allies. Dan’Tonk, the Horse Clans, the orcish tribes — all these bolster Weldyn’s armies. The more we can defeat, the weaker Asheviere will become."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Or elsewise, we must acquire more allies of our own! We may find friends among the elves of the Lintanir — I have spent time there before. There are woses in the east as well, and drakes; who knows what else may await us!"),
          },
