          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Faghmok",
            text: _("Ha ha ha, I knew you’d come find me. Very good."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Faghmok",
            text: _("I’m prepared to sneak you and three of your best soldiers into the center of our camp. Once you’re there, it’ll be up to you to kill the old chief — and then I can take over!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Or, once we’re separated from our army you will capture us and turn us over to Asheviere. Why should I take such a great risk on the word of a stranger?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Faghmok",
            text: _("Bah, I don’t get to be chief unless you kill the old chief! But if you must have some guarantee... fine, I’ll stay prisoner with your army until you safely return. Now what do you say?"),
          },
        ],
      },
