          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_1320",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Parandra",
            text: _("How quickly does the race of men mature! Only seventeen winters have passed since I last laid eyes on you, Konrad, yet you are now a grown man. A proven warrior stands before me!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Forgive me, Elf, but I’m afraid I do not recall meeting you before."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("Konrad, this is Parandra. When Asheviere first took power and her orcs began rampaging across Wesnoth, Parandra helped me rescue you from the royal palace."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I had no idea! Thank you, my lady. It is a pleasure to meet you again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("Rescued him from my mother? Seventeen years ago Konrad would’ve been an infant. What is this you’re talking about?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Your mother has much blood upon her hands, child. She has had many killed unjustly. When Konrad was an infant, she ordered all the princes put to death, so she could seize control."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("Not long ago I would’ve decried such an obvious lie. But Konrad and Delfador have shown me many things of which I didn’t wish to believe regarding my mother. I trust that you speak the truth."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_1321",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_1322",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Konrad is the rightful heir; the son of Arand and nephew of Garard. I have raised him as my own, as penance for my part in Garard’s fall. Konrad shall be king."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Parandra",
            x: 91,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Parandra",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Parandra",
            text: _("(gestures to Delfador)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Delfador",
            x: 92,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Parandra",
            text: _("<span size='small'>_Delfador, you have raised Konrad to be skillful and wise, honorable and just. A warrior who has respect, and appreciates peace. Yet the throne is not the place for him. You know of what I speak, Delfador.</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("<span size='small'>_Parandra, what you say may seem right to some, but as long as you and I speak to no-one of what we know, I see no reason why Konrad would not best have the throne.</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Parandra",
            text: _("<span size='small'>_In so many things you are right, Delfador, and your wisdom is unmatched in the world of men. But in this, you are mistaken. Li’sar is the heir. She should take the throne. Now that I have met her for myself, I am sure of it.</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("<span size='small'>_Hmph. Perhaps you are right, perhaps not. We shall see.</span>"),
          },
          {
