          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Tip: The season of the year changes every time you finish a battle. Winter battles will have longer nights and shorter days, often with more snow and ice. Summer battles are the opposite. _ Right now it’s winter. You can see the current season in the top-right-hand corner."),
