            text: _("Thank you for offering us asylum — even the elves of the Aethenwood recognize your authority. It’s a high honor to finally meet you in person."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("And you as well, friend Konrad. I have not seen you since you were very young, shortly after the deaths... of your brothers. From what I hear of your actions, Delfador would be proud of the king you are becoming."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("But this is no idle visit of reminiscence, for I bring word from Lintanir Forest. Your mentor called upon the advice of the elvish sages some weeks ago, Konrad."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Delfador, the strands of prophecy are moving — you know she of whom I speak. May we take a moment in private?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
