            unit: "roc_delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Gone! And with hardly a word. What’s this quest about, Kalenz?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_1655",
        on: "branch_if_1655",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "status_s10",
            not_equals: "completed",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Who are you, stranger? Your ears are forked, but I don’t recognize you from the Aethenwood — even your clothes look foreign. Friend or foe?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Friend, Konrad. I am Kalenz, eldest in the Lintanir and High Lord of all elves. Greetings."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-glad.webp",
            text: _("Kalenz! Delfador has told me so much about you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-glad.webp",
            text: _("Thank you for offering us asylum — even the elves of the Aethenwood recognize your authority. I am sorry for the price they paid. It’s a high honor to finally meet you in person."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("And you as well, friend Konrad. I have not seen you since you were very young, shortly after the deaths of your brothers. From what I hear of your actions, you should be proud of the king you are becoming."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("But this is no idle visit of reminiscence, for I bring grim news. The city of Elensefar — that which was defended so staunchly by your mentor Delfador and Lord Maddock — has been conquered."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-mad.webp",
            text: _("No! Has Delfador been taken prisoner? Is he hurt? We must march at once to his aid!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Your mentor is alive and well, Konrad. He could not rejoin you here today, but he left you a brief message. Ahem..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador.webp",
            text: _("<i>_ I depart for the Heart Mountains at once, Konrad. An urgent matter has come up that demands my attention. It is something you need not concern yourself with just yet.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("That’s it? We’ve hardly had a moment of peace together since the Aethenwood, and this is all he has to say. Kalenz, what is this quest about?"),
          },
        ],
      },
