            text: _("Any other time I would have insisted on stopping to help these poor people! But I’ve been instructed to meet with Delfador at once."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Delfador is just north of here. With so many orcs nearby, the Doors are closed to us. But I can still loop around to the west, north, then east, through the Caverns of Chaincolt."),
